WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.835
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:06.105 --> 00:08.065
How do you feel about him?

3
00:08.745 --> 00:09.905
He's pretty cute.

4
00:09.985 --> 00:10.985
Nice smile.

5
00:11.065 --> 00:12.425
Good at guitar.

6
00:12.505 --> 00:14.025
And he sings well.

7
00:14.105 --> 00:15.505
But he's a bit too private.

8
00:17.105 --> 00:18.265
You can open your eyes now.

9
00:19.505 --> 00:23.345
Too scared to say I love you

10
00:23.425 --> 00:25.145
I can smell success.

11
00:25.225 --> 00:26.825
Have you seen the post on X?

12
00:27.585 --> 00:28.545
What post?

13
00:29.065 --> 00:30.825
Male idol with the initials P.T.

14
00:31.745 --> 00:33.265
He's violent.

15
00:33.345 --> 00:36.025
He once beat someone so badly they ended up in the hospital.

16
00:38.345 --> 00:40.025
MISSALLSUNDAY: WAKE UP, EVERYONE.

17
00:40.105 --> 00:41.665
-P.T. is Phatee. -I don't know him.

18
00:41.745 --> 00:43.425
-P.T.? It has to be him. -Unbelievable!

19
00:44.025 --> 00:45.145
-He hurt someone. -Unfollowed.

20
00:45.225 --> 00:46.625
How disappointing.

21
00:47.585 --> 00:48.585
I unfollowed him.

22
00:48.665 --> 00:51.345
-I'm so disappointed. -When will the label say something?

23
00:51.425 --> 00:53.185
I'll hold a press conference.

24
00:53.265 --> 00:55.825
Phatee, just stick to this script.

25
00:55.905 --> 00:59.385
Just tell them you didn't do it.

26
00:59.465 --> 01:01.185
Let the whole thing blow over.

27
01:02.865 --> 01:04.344
I can't deny it.

28
01:06.345 --> 01:07.705
Because I really did it.

29
01:08.425 --> 01:09.865
You? Hurt someone?

30
01:10.585 --> 01:11.705
No way.

31
01:12.345 --> 01:14.065
There must be a reason.

32
01:15.185 --> 01:17.105
Whatever the reason,

33
01:18.585 --> 01:20.265
I still ended up hurting someone.

34
01:21.305 --> 01:24.425
I don't care whether you did it or not.

35
01:25.025 --> 01:27.865
Just say these lines in front of everyone.

36
01:28.465 --> 01:30.025
Even if I lie,

37
01:30.705 --> 01:33.105
people will find out the truth someday.

38
01:34.425 --> 01:36.185
If you want me to speak,

39
01:36.785 --> 01:38.585
I'll only tell the truth.

40
01:39.825 --> 01:41.385
But if you won't let me speak,

41
01:42.865 --> 01:44.745
I'll take responsibility by leaving the band.

42
01:46.945 --> 01:48.305
Phatee.

43
01:48.385 --> 01:49.945
Calm down.

44
01:50.545 --> 01:52.625
We can take our time finding a solution.

45
01:57.185 --> 01:58.185
This is it.

46
01:59.105 --> 02:00.425
The solution.

47
02:01.865 --> 02:03.785
Leaving the band is the best thing to do.

48
02:05.065 --> 02:06.945
Don't you want to be an artist anymore?

49
02:07.665 --> 02:09.785
If you don't follow the script,

50
02:09.864 --> 02:11.945
your career will be over.

51
02:13.105 --> 02:15.745
Are you really willing to let that happen, Phatee?

52
02:21.665 --> 02:22.665
Yes.

53
02:23.505 --> 02:25.185
I really can't lie.

54
02:30.185 --> 02:31.465
Phatee!

55
02:31.545 --> 02:33.105
Phatee, wait!

56
02:33.185 --> 02:34.585
Phatee, hold on!

57
02:34.665 --> 02:35.745
Phatee, let's talk first.

58
02:37.025 --> 02:38.665
What exactly happened?

59
02:38.745 --> 02:40.425
Why did you hurt those people?

60
02:40.505 --> 02:41.825
Phatee.

61
02:44.305 --> 02:45.625
Can't you even tell me?

62
02:49.065 --> 02:50.065
No.

63
02:52.545 --> 02:53.945
So you're just giving up

64
02:54.025 --> 02:57.145
and leaving me, leaving everyone like this?

65
02:59.345 --> 03:00.505
Phatee.

66
03:01.545 --> 03:03.425
We've fought so hard to get this far.

67
03:05.185 --> 03:06.585
We're about to release an album.

68
03:06.665 --> 03:08.465
Soon, we'll have concerts.

69
03:10.025 --> 03:11.625
Don't forget your dream.

70
03:14.185 --> 03:15.705
If I stay in the band…

71
03:18.185 --> 03:19.665
everyone else will suffer.

72
03:21.865 --> 03:23.905
This is for the best.

73
03:33.225 --> 03:34.505
Come on.

74
03:34.585 --> 03:36.785
Kao will sort this out for us anyway, right?

75
03:36.865 --> 03:38.465
Just think of it this way.

76
03:38.545 --> 03:40.185
This could make our band famous.

77
03:40.825 --> 03:44.625
Any publicity is good publicity. Right?

78
03:46.505 --> 03:47.545
I'm telling you,

79
03:47.625 --> 03:49.345
this kind of fame will only ruin us.

80
03:50.745 --> 03:52.545
Haven't you seen social media?

81
03:52.625 --> 03:54.705
People are tearing Phatee apart.

82
03:54.785 --> 03:56.505
It's even reached my DMs.

83
03:58.185 --> 04:01.065
So, has Phatee told you anything?

84
04:02.625 --> 04:04.025
Nothing.

85
04:04.105 --> 04:05.785
He won't answer any of my questions.

86
04:08.625 --> 04:10.625
I hate to be this blunt…

87
04:14.225 --> 04:16.504
but Phatee leaving the band

88
04:16.585 --> 04:17.785
would be the best solution.

89
04:18.624 --> 04:20.345
Otherwise, our band is screwed.

90
04:21.825 --> 04:23.065
We're screwed either way.

91
04:24.065 --> 04:25.585
Without Phatee,

92
04:25.665 --> 04:27.025
our band can't go on.

93
04:28.065 --> 04:30.265
Kao only promotes those who can sell.

94
04:30.345 --> 04:32.225
That's just Phatee and Ranne.

95
04:32.305 --> 04:33.545
Without Phatee,

96
04:34.145 --> 04:35.465
she'll only promote you.

97
04:35.545 --> 04:36.545
No way.

98
04:37.305 --> 04:39.345
How could she abandon you guys?

99
04:40.705 --> 04:42.305
I won't let the band break up.

100
04:43.465 --> 04:44.985
No matter what,

101
04:45.065 --> 04:46.425
we have to stick together.

102
06:05.505 --> 06:06.865
Here are your snacks.

103
06:06.945 --> 06:07.785
Thank you.

104
06:07.865 --> 06:09.305
Anything else?

105
06:10.065 --> 06:11.025
Hey!

106
06:11.105 --> 06:12.585
Don't you have practice today?

107
06:14.865 --> 06:16.025
I've left the band.

108
06:17.985 --> 06:19.305
Mimi.

109
06:19.385 --> 06:20.665
Do you think he's okay?

110
06:21.745 --> 06:22.665
Hey.

111
06:22.745 --> 06:24.225
What a weird question.

112
06:24.305 --> 06:26.105
How could he be okay?

113
06:26.185 --> 06:27.945
He's getting so much hate.

114
06:30.105 --> 06:30.945
Hey.

115
06:32.025 --> 06:34.105
Hey, hey, hey!

116
06:42.265 --> 06:43.985
Violent scumbag.

117
06:44.625 --> 06:46.945
How dare he still sing at this place?

118
06:48.105 --> 06:50.625
Please don't disturb the other customers.

119
06:52.265 --> 06:53.265
What?

120
06:53.345 --> 06:55.745
Does anyone want to hear this sadist sing?

121
06:56.305 --> 06:58.825
If you've got guts, turn around and sing!

122
06:58.905 --> 07:01.065
Hey, want some popcorn, buddy?

123
07:01.585 --> 07:02.865
When you hurt other people,

124
07:02.945 --> 07:05.865
-you weren't ashamed at all. -Hey, calm down, guys.

125
07:06.585 --> 07:07.945
Let's talk this through.

126
07:09.745 --> 07:10.865
Would you like anything else?

127
07:11.585 --> 07:12.465
No.

128
07:16.545 --> 07:18.585
-Hey, hey, hey! -Wait, wait, wait!

129
07:18.665 --> 07:20.305
Where's the rush? Let's talk first.

130
07:20.385 --> 07:22.105
-Don't you understand? -Hey, let's talk, damn it!

131
07:22.185 --> 07:23.665
Are you deaf?

132
07:24.305 --> 07:25.185
Huh?

133
07:26.225 --> 07:27.225
Hey!

134
07:29.145 --> 07:31.185
You already went down? I barely even tried.

135
07:32.865 --> 07:34.825
I own this place.

136
07:35.625 --> 07:37.065
I don't care

137
07:37.145 --> 07:38.265
who you are.

138
07:38.345 --> 07:40.145
But if you want to keep fighting,

139
07:40.745 --> 07:41.905
take it outside.

140
07:48.905 --> 07:50.785
This place is doomed

141
07:50.865 --> 07:52.665
if you keep supporting that asshole.

142
08:00.585 --> 08:01.585
Phatee.

143
08:02.665 --> 08:03.985
Come upstairs and talk to me.

144
08:15.545 --> 08:17.345
Anything you want to tell me, Phatee?

145
08:23.465 --> 08:24.905
I'm no longer an artist.

146
08:26.585 --> 08:28.145
I can't sing at the club either.

147
08:30.025 --> 08:31.945
I probably can't pay you rent.

148
08:33.105 --> 08:34.865
I think I should leave.

149
08:37.425 --> 08:38.745
You're leaving?

150
08:40.705 --> 08:42.144
You won't survive out there.

151
08:43.264 --> 08:44.905
When I give you a job,

152
08:44.985 --> 08:46.305
learn to take it for a change.

153
08:48.385 --> 08:52.065
You don't have to move out. Stay here.

154
08:58.465 --> 08:59.545
Stop.

155
09:08.225 --> 09:09.705
Aren't you going downstairs to sing?

156
09:13.785 --> 09:14.785
Yes.

157
09:15.625 --> 09:16.785
Thank you.

158
09:42.305 --> 09:44.585
The label should take action.

159
09:44.665 --> 09:47.265
I feel bad for the other members in the band.

160
09:47.345 --> 09:49.785
Won't you do anything?

161
09:50.985 --> 09:52.545
Why keep him? Just fire him

162
09:52.625 --> 09:55.305
and give someone with actual talent a chance.

163
09:55.385 --> 09:58.105
He almost beat someone to death, yet he got off the hook.

164
09:58.185 --> 10:01.185
He must have connections. That's why he got to debut at all.

165
10:01.265 --> 10:04.425
I hope the label starts promoting someone else instead.

166
10:14.385 --> 10:16.545
If it's money, I'd love to take it.

167
10:16.625 --> 10:18.425
But if it's about Phatee,

168
10:19.105 --> 10:20.385
I don't think I can.

169
10:21.065 --> 10:22.025
I understand.

170
10:22.625 --> 10:25.185
And I accept Phatee's decision.

171
10:26.505 --> 10:28.945
But I won't let anyone spread fake news

172
10:29.025 --> 10:30.665
to hurt others and get away with it.

173
10:32.065 --> 10:34.025
I want to hire the Crows

174
10:34.105 --> 10:36.185
to track down the Miss All Sunday account.

175
10:38.185 --> 10:39.625
In that case,

176
10:39.705 --> 10:41.745
The Crow Club is happy to help.

177
10:51.865 --> 10:54.785
What is it, Linda? Why did you call me here this late?

178
10:54.865 --> 10:56.225
We've got a job.

179
10:56.865 --> 10:59.745
What job? I'm going back to Japan in two days.

180
10:59.825 --> 11:01.305
That's why I called you here so urgently.

181
11:01.385 --> 11:04.985
We need to find the owner of the Miss All Sunday account before then.

182
11:05.785 --> 11:06.625
Sunday what?

183
11:06.705 --> 11:08.585
No way. I'm not looking for it.

184
11:09.785 --> 11:11.545
It's an anti-Phatee account,

185
11:11.625 --> 11:13.225
the one that made a post

186
11:13.305 --> 11:14.745
saying Phatee beat someone up.

187
11:15.585 --> 11:17.225
You should've led with that.

188
11:17.905 --> 11:19.425
Let's go. What are you waiting for?

189
11:34.545 --> 11:35.745
You've been searching since yesterday.

190
11:35.825 --> 11:37.385
Still haven't found it, Vann?

191
11:37.465 --> 11:38.705
Come on!

192
11:38.785 --> 11:40.385
It's not as easy as it looks on TV.

193
11:40.465 --> 11:41.665
It takes time.

194
11:41.745 --> 11:43.905
If it weren't for Phatee,

195
11:43.985 --> 11:47.225
I wouldn't sacrifice a romantic day with my boyfriend to stare at a computer.

196
11:49.865 --> 11:51.345
I could fly over with you.

197
11:52.825 --> 11:54.305
So we can spend a little more time together.

198
11:56.225 --> 11:58.265
You two are always being lovey-dovey.

199
12:00.305 --> 12:01.945
Don't be jealous of me.

200
12:02.025 --> 12:03.665
You've got that writer now.

201
12:04.465 --> 12:06.025
Wow!

202
12:06.105 --> 12:07.345
A fierce tiger like Talay

203
12:07.425 --> 12:09.025
got pounced on by his prey!

204
12:10.945 --> 12:12.345
Prey is still prey, damn it!

205
12:12.425 --> 12:14.345
Once I'm bored, I'll walk away.

206
12:14.425 --> 12:15.465
Stay out of my business.

207
12:15.545 --> 12:17.265
Worry about yourself.

208
12:25.265 --> 12:26.625
What happens if you find that account?

209
12:26.705 --> 12:29.145
I'll beat the crap out of them.

210
12:29.945 --> 12:31.065
And then what?

211
12:31.145 --> 12:32.905
Nothing will change anyway.

212
12:32.985 --> 12:33.865
That's true.

213
12:34.905 --> 12:37.545
But I won't let anyone keep hurting you.

214
12:38.385 --> 12:40.305
Even if it doesn't solve anything,

215
12:40.385 --> 12:42.905
they won't get to live in peace.

216
12:49.425 --> 12:50.625
Hey.

217
12:50.705 --> 12:52.345
Your future boyfriend

218
12:52.425 --> 12:53.545
is pretty fierce.

219
12:54.105 --> 12:56.545
Don't do anything to upset him.

220
12:56.625 --> 12:58.225
Otherwise, your life

221
12:58.905 --> 13:00.025
is over.

222
13:02.465 --> 13:03.665
Found it!

223
13:04.425 --> 13:05.865
I've located this account!

224
13:18.505 --> 13:20.465
-Stop, stop! -Right here.

225
13:20.545 --> 13:23.305
-Here? -I think this is it.

226
13:23.385 --> 13:25.825
This is the location Vann sent.

227
13:50.665 --> 13:52.425
What are you doing here, Ranne?

228
13:52.505 --> 13:53.585
Come on in.

229
13:56.425 --> 13:57.705
Why the hell did you do this?

230
14:00.665 --> 14:01.785
What did I do?

231
14:03.145 --> 14:04.905
You're Miss All Sunday, aren't you?

232
14:06.105 --> 14:08.345
The account that spread news about Phatee

233
14:08.425 --> 14:09.905
and hurt our band.

234
14:10.425 --> 14:11.785
You did it, didn't you?

235
14:12.385 --> 14:13.425
What are you talking about?

236
14:14.705 --> 14:17.265
I had someone trace that account's IP address.

237
14:18.065 --> 14:20.385
And it led straight to your house.

238
14:20.465 --> 14:21.785
What am I supposed to think?

239
14:22.425 --> 14:23.425
Are you crazy?

240
14:23.505 --> 14:24.465
Why would I do that?

241
14:24.545 --> 14:25.905
I've fought alongside you!

242
14:25.985 --> 14:27.745
Then who else could it be?

243
14:39.465 --> 14:41.385
I heard shouting, so I came down to see.

244
14:43.705 --> 14:44.905
Tontoey.

245
14:44.985 --> 14:46.065
Tontoey!

246
14:46.145 --> 14:47.545
Tontoey!

247
14:48.305 --> 14:49.345
Tontoey!

248
15:00.065 --> 15:01.065
What are you doing?

249
15:11.505 --> 15:12.705
Tontoey.

250
15:12.785 --> 15:14.305
Show me your laptop.

251
15:15.225 --> 15:16.225
Why?

252
15:17.305 --> 15:19.025
The IP address is here.

253
15:19.105 --> 15:20.905
And there are only two of us here.

254
15:23.105 --> 15:24.265
Show me your laptop.

255
15:24.905 --> 15:26.705
What? Are you playing a prank on me?

256
15:26.785 --> 15:28.385
Tontoey, I'm not joking.

257
15:51.345 --> 15:52.625
Tontoey!

258
15:52.705 --> 15:53.905
Tontoey!

259
15:56.345 --> 15:57.345
Tontoey.

260
15:57.865 --> 15:58.865
Tontoey.

261
16:02.745 --> 16:04.665
Tontoey.

262
16:04.745 --> 16:05.785
Why did you do this?

263
16:05.865 --> 16:07.265
It's my band.

264
16:07.865 --> 16:09.305
Well, that's exactly why.

265
16:09.385 --> 16:10.585
I did this for you.

266
16:11.105 --> 16:12.305
Don't you know

267
16:12.385 --> 16:14.145
your label only promotes those two?

268
16:15.025 --> 16:17.265
You practice like crazy,

269
16:17.345 --> 16:19.985
yet people barely even know your name.

270
16:20.065 --> 16:21.825
You're better than those two.

271
16:21.905 --> 16:23.465
You're way too talented

272
16:23.545 --> 16:25.545
to be in a band that only sells fanservice.

273
16:26.745 --> 16:28.265
But it's my friends' band.

274
16:28.345 --> 16:29.305
My band.

275
16:29.385 --> 16:30.985
You have no right to do this.

276
16:31.065 --> 16:32.945
What did I do wrong?

277
16:33.025 --> 16:34.785
I just told the truth.

278
16:34.865 --> 16:36.865
Phatee really stabbed someone.

279
16:36.945 --> 16:38.225
He has to admit

280
16:38.305 --> 16:39.385
he's a psychopath

281
16:39.465 --> 16:40.945
who loves violence.

282
16:42.945 --> 16:44.185
Tontoey.

283
17:13.865 --> 17:15.105
Come back and join us.

284
17:16.224 --> 17:17.704
Let's be A-Team again.

285
17:25.184 --> 17:27.184
You've written so many songs.

286
17:27.265 --> 17:28.665
It'd be such a shame

287
17:28.745 --> 17:30.465
if these songs stayed just words on paper.

288
17:31.585 --> 17:33.705
You can sing my songs.

289
17:33.785 --> 17:35.665
I've written quite a few for you.

290
17:35.745 --> 17:39.025
No way. You should sing your own songs.

291
17:41.865 --> 17:42.865
Phatee.

292
17:44.305 --> 17:45.385
Trust me.

293
17:46.305 --> 17:47.945
Do what Kao says,

294
17:48.625 --> 17:50.185
and everything will get better.

295
17:51.545 --> 17:53.105
But I don't want to lie.

296
17:53.625 --> 17:55.065
You don't have to lie.

297
17:55.865 --> 17:58.465
Just tell everyone what happened.

298
17:59.065 --> 18:01.385
I believe you're not that kind of person.

299
18:02.105 --> 18:04.225
Everyone will understand you.

300
18:08.345 --> 18:10.785
You belong on stage.

301
18:11.825 --> 18:13.385
For both my first album

302
18:13.465 --> 18:14.905
and my first concert,

303
18:16.305 --> 18:17.945
I want you to be part of them.

304
18:20.065 --> 18:21.985
I want to be on stage with you too.

305
18:22.665 --> 18:24.665
Playing guitar and singing together.

306
18:27.225 --> 18:29.025
Then let's do that together.

307
19:00.505 --> 19:03.705
Would you like to tell your side of the story?

308
19:03.785 --> 19:06.105
You don't have to follow my script.

309
19:06.785 --> 19:09.065
If you want to tell it, come to the building.

310
19:09.145 --> 19:11.745
I'll have a team ready to record a video.

311
19:11.825 --> 19:14.345
KAO: WOULD YOU LIKE TO TELL YOUR SIDE OF THE STORY?

312
19:16.425 --> 19:17.785
It's all over Twitter.

313
19:17.865 --> 19:19.865
-It's all over Twitter! -What's going on?

314
19:19.945 --> 19:22.225
-Why won't the label say anything? -Yeah.

315
19:23.025 --> 19:25.385
-Will we get to know anything? -So what now?

316
19:25.465 --> 19:27.705
-I don't understand. -We've been waiting long enough.

317
19:27.785 --> 19:28.905
We've been waiting for 15 minutes.

318
19:28.985 --> 19:32.785
-Is the story about Phatee true? -Is it true?

319
19:32.865 --> 19:36.105
The company is discussing it. Please wait for the press conference.

320
19:36.185 --> 19:39.785
You can't just say that!

321
19:55.825 --> 19:57.065
Phatee.

322
20:02.425 --> 20:03.385
Hey.

